et specified, and everyone was crouched behind the sofa in a silence that felt, to Kofi, dangerously fragile.\n\nThe front door opened at five past five. There was a beat of pure, held-breath quiet, and then the whole room erupted at once, Leo loudest of anyone, as if he personally hadn't spent the previous forty minutes threatening to ruin the entire thing.","quotationRequired":["a nervous habit he'd developed roughly every ninety seconds","entirely unbothered"],"validationTier":"TIER3_QUOTATION_PLUS_EXPLANATION"}$json$,
