ed to notice, the lights were dimmed exactly as the spreadsheet specified, and everyone was crouched behind the sofa in a silence that felt, to Kofi, dangerously fragile.\n\nThe front door opened at five past five. There was a beat of pure, held-breath quiet, and then the whole room erupted at once, Leo loudest of anyone, as if he personally hadn't spent the previous forty minutes threatening to ruin the entire thing.","correctOptions":["A","B","D","F"],"requiredSelectionCount":4,"validationTier":"TIER6_MULTI_SELECT"}$json$,
 'Educational Increment 007C completion. Assessment Brain QT-RC-09, primary competency RC-01. Question family: wave2-fam-multiselect. Transfer class: NEAR_TRANSFER. Real evidence basis: direct reading of CSSE-003/005/008/013 (2021/2022/2023 Main Test papers and 2023 marking scheme, Level A, Founder-Accepted), reconciled in Educational Increments 007A/007B/007C. Answer validation: TIER6_MULTI_SELECT.', 2, 'wave2-eng-surprise',
