The front door opened at five past five. There was a beat of pure, held-breath quiet, and then the whole room erupted at once, Leo loudest of anyone, as if he personally hadn't spent the previous forty minutes threatening to ruin the entire thing.","orderedAnswer":["taping the streamer to the doorframe","nearly answering the video call","the lights being dimmed"],"validationTier":"TIER4_ORDERED_LIST"}$json$,
 'Educational Increment 007C completion. Assessment Brain QT-RC-06, primary competency RC-04. Question family: wave1-fam-sequencing. Transfer class: NEAR_TRANSFER. Real evidence basis: direct reading of CSSE-003/005/008/013 (2021/2022/2023 Main Test papers and 2023 marking scheme, Level A, Founder-Accepted), reconciled in Educational Increments 007A/007B/007C. Answer validation: TIER4_ORDERED_LIST.', 2, 'wave2-eng-surprise',
